    "body": "Backports #35878 to 30.x.\n\nCherry-pick of 1278a5970d5ada0979052a5bad899e896b8ab40b. No conflicts, the diff is identical to the original commit.\n\nTested locally (Debian bookworm, gcc, RelWithDebInfo): `p2p_tx_download.py` (contains `test_duplicate_tx_inv` from that commit), `p2p_orphan_handling.py` and `p2p_opportunistic_1p1c.py` pass. Unit tests and the rest of the functional suite were not run.\n\nContributed by [turingpoint](https://www.turingpoint.de).",
